{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"对称幺半 ∞-范畴"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"对称幺半∞-范畴"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对称幺半 ∞-范畴是"},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"无穷范畴"}},{"Plain":"语境中的"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", 是 $(\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\infty},\\times)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-空间","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-空间"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}